From: Gerasim Troeglazov <3dEyes@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 10:28:38 +1000
Subject: Fall back to monotonic clock in NowIncludingSuspendMs when
 CLOCK_BOOTTIME is unavailable


diff --git a/mozglue/misc/Now.cpp b/mozglue/misc/Now.cpp
